<li id="S4.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The PSNR, SSIM, and LPIPS of HyCa are computed with respect to the outputs of the corresponding distilled baseline models.</p>
